  `stringResource(Res.string.foo, args)` in a Composable context, or
  `getString(Res.string.foo, args)` in any coroutine context (snackbars
  fired from a ViewModel / Router, suspend lambdas, etc).

  New user-facing strings always go here, not inline at the callsite —
  see `docs/todo.md` "Strings — centralize everything in
  :libraries:resources". Naming convention: `{surface}_{role}_{specifier}`.
-->
